(text "window (130 mm board limit), wired to pads. On the 5807 cut the 5V jumper (all open = 20 V) and the 1A" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "7731f396-6d98-5559-a645-bef97d689072"))
(text "jumper (both current jumpers open = 3 A)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 43.18000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "3a675a70-9f78-5b7c-844d-324c280e9516"))
(text "Charge ground (review B1): the common XL4015 CC/CV module measures current with a shunt between IN- and" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 48.260000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "dd3d79fb-9da6-59cb-977c-d4b0285b0d00"))
(text "OUT-. So the charger side has its own net CHG_GND (PD trigger GND, CC/CV IN-, D501, C501, the charger-present" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "5df1cfee-9f1d-5d39-88d9-093e535fa9f1"))
(text "detector) and CC/CV OUT- is its only tie to GND: the charge current returns through the shunt and CC works. A" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 58.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "513297bc-0182-5367-9e7e-454ed7f70d1c"))
(text "module with high-side sensing (IN- and OUT- joined inside) works on the same pads. Bench check in README." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 63.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "4223b51e-a43d-5d89-be2d-e9052f69d7bc"))
(text "Reverse block: Q501 IRF4905 with its body diode toward the pack, turned fully on only while CHG_IN > ~17.5 V" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 68.58000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "01d7522e-569a-5db6-8f11-cfcf2eb0ff97"))
(text "(1N5247B 17 V zener + Q502), so a 5/9/12/15 V PD fallback never enables it. No diode drop at the end of" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 73.66 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "08183cec-336e-586e-93cc-f67444ef9f17"))
(text "charge, so the buck CV is set to 16.80 V (4.20 V/cell), not 17.1 V (PHASE2 assumed a diode)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 78.74000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "643d389a-04ea-507e-8bbb-a2e785cb436e"))
(text "Q503 gives the Pico CHG_PRESENT_N (open collector, no back-power into an unpowered Pico)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 83.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "b7681b38-d9db-54fb-8cf1-395a41823ca7"))
(text "5 A mini blade fuse into BAT. The pack-side current goes through the XT90 and the BMS common port." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 88.9 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "77fa9b0f-ba20-5b38-a64a-db6ee4fad3b4"))
